WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.370
- You know, it's funny, usually

00:00:01.370 --> 00:00:04.660
in a domestic defamation
dispute like this,

00:00:04.660 --> 00:00:06.630
the internet has all kinds of opinions,

00:00:06.630 --> 00:00:08.260
but they've been completely silent

00:00:08.260 --> 00:00:11.358
about Johnny Depp and
Amber Heard, it's weird.

00:00:11.358 --> 00:00:14.025
(intense music)

00:00:15.010 --> 00:00:16.576
Oh, okay.

00:00:23.578 --> 00:00:26.618
This is all incredibly crazy.

00:00:26.618 --> 00:00:29.068
And this latest suit and countersuit

00:00:29.068 --> 00:00:31.348
is already turning into a circus.

00:00:31.348 --> 00:00:34.248
Of course, for Hollywood
celebrities leading public lives.

00:00:34.248 --> 00:00:35.788
It seems like there's no such thing

00:00:35.788 --> 00:00:37.688
as a truly private matter.

00:00:37.688 --> 00:00:39.928
And this has certainly been
the case for Amber Heard

00:00:39.928 --> 00:00:42.548
who has publicly accused
her ex-husband Johnny Depp

00:00:42.548 --> 00:00:45.617
of subjecting her to years of
physical and emotional abuse

00:00:45.617 --> 00:00:48.678
during their marriage
and Depp for his part

00:00:48.678 --> 00:00:50.708
has vehemently denied the allegations,

00:00:50.708 --> 00:00:53.588
accusing Heard of defaming
him with fabricated claims

00:00:53.588 --> 00:00:56.298
while portraying Heard as the real abuser.

00:00:56.298 --> 00:00:59.268
And while Heard has primarily
aired her grievances

00:00:59.268 --> 00:01:01.278
to the media, Depp has
opted to take his fight

00:01:01.278 --> 00:01:05.298
to the courtroom in both the
UK and the state of Virginia.

00:01:05.298 --> 00:01:08.238
Now determining the truth of
domestic violence allegations

00:01:08.238 --> 00:01:10.140
is invariably a challenging prospect.

00:01:10.140 --> 00:01:13.268
As a result, the public's
response to these allegations

00:01:13.268 --> 00:01:15.648
has been incredibly polarizing

00:01:15.648 --> 00:01:17.928
with Heard and Depp having
their own supporters

00:01:17.928 --> 00:01:19.218
and detractors alike.

00:01:19.218 --> 00:01:20.098
So legal eagles,

00:01:20.098 --> 00:01:23.288
let's talk about the Johnny
Depp Amber Heard saga,

00:01:23.288 --> 00:01:25.548
we'll cover the facts leading
up to the decades long dispute

00:01:25.548 --> 00:01:27.318
between the former celebrity couple,

00:01:27.318 --> 00:01:29.818
review the multimillion
dollar defamation lawsuits

00:01:29.818 --> 00:01:32.098
in the UK and the US that
have been brought as a result

00:01:35.218 --> 00:01:37.592
for basically the same thing.

00:01:37.592 --> 00:01:40.259
(upbeat music)

00:01:41.691 --> 00:01:42.851
Now the former Hollywood couple's

00:01:42.851 --> 00:01:45.141
Virginia courtroom
confrontation is the culmination

00:01:45.141 --> 00:01:48.751
of 10 years of love, heartbreak
and abuse allegations

00:01:48.751 --> 00:01:51.141
between the "Pirate of
the Caribbean" actor

00:01:51.141 --> 00:01:52.951
and the "Justice League" actress.

00:01:52.951 --> 00:01:55.321
Here is the timeline of how this feud left

00:01:55.321 --> 00:01:57.491
from the tabloids to the courtroom.

00:01:57.491 --> 00:01:59.681
Now in 2012, Johnny Depp and Amber Heard,

00:01:59.681 --> 00:02:01.231
began dating following Depp's split

00:02:01.231 --> 00:02:04.591
from his longtime partner,
French model actress, singer,

00:02:04.591 --> 00:02:05.991
Vanessa Paradis.

00:02:05.991 --> 00:02:07.991
Depp and Paradis dated for 14 years.

00:02:07.991 --> 00:02:09.881
And they shared two children together.

00:02:09.881 --> 00:02:12.611
In February of 2015 Depp and
Heard officially tied the knot.

00:02:12.611 --> 00:02:14.821
But as quickly as the pair fell in love,

00:02:14.821 --> 00:02:17.061
things fell apart just as swiftly.

00:02:17.061 --> 00:02:19.781
On May 21st, 2016, the LAPD responded

00:02:19.781 --> 00:02:21.471
to a Saturday night call in which Heard

00:02:21.471 --> 00:02:23.141
alleged domestic abuse.

00:02:23.141 --> 00:02:24.481
Law enforcement officials at the time

00:02:24.481 --> 00:02:26.741
stated they found quote
no evidence of any crime

00:02:26.741 --> 00:02:29.521
and Heard did not file any charges.

00:02:29.521 --> 00:02:32.661
On May 23rd, 2016 Heard
officially filed for divorce

00:02:32.661 --> 00:02:35.081
from Depp citing
irreconcilable differences.

00:02:35.081 --> 00:02:37.901
Four days later, Heard
appeared in a Los Angeles court

00:02:37.901 --> 00:02:38.851
with a bruised cheek

00:02:38.851 --> 00:02:41.481
to request a temporary
restraining order against Depp.

00:02:41.481 --> 00:02:43.161
In a sworn declaration Heard alleged

00:02:43.161 --> 00:02:45.673
that her then husband 23 years her senior

00:02:45.673 --> 00:02:48.091
had quote violently attacked her

00:02:48.091 --> 00:02:51.381
and thrown a cellphone at
her face with extreme force.

00:02:51.381 --> 00:02:52.971
Photographs submitted
to the court show Heard

00:02:52.971 --> 00:02:54.401
with a large bruise on her face,

00:02:54.401 --> 00:02:56.481
along with broken bottles, picture frames

00:02:56.481 --> 00:02:58.371
and shattered glass on the floor.

00:02:58.371 --> 00:02:59.511
Heard alleges that quote

00:02:59.511 --> 00:03:01.641
during the entirety of our relationship,

00:03:01.641 --> 00:03:05.211
Johnny has been verbally and
physically abusive end quote.

00:03:05.211 --> 00:03:07.021
Heard further claimed that she quote

00:03:07.021 --> 00:03:09.911
endured excessive, emotional,
verbal, and physical abuse,

00:03:09.911 --> 00:03:11.961
which has included angry,
hostile, humiliating,

00:03:11.961 --> 00:03:13.061
and threatening assaults to me,

00:03:13.061 --> 00:03:15.871
whenever I questioned his
authority or disagreed with him.

00:03:15.871 --> 00:03:17.229
Now in her filings Heard recounted

00:03:17.229 --> 00:03:19.201
an alleged April 21st assault

00:03:19.201 --> 00:03:21.911
wherein Depp allegedly came home drunk

00:03:21.911 --> 00:03:23.831
as Heard's birthday party was ending,

00:03:23.831 --> 00:03:27.376
through a champagne bottle
at a wall, grabbed her hair,

00:03:27.376 --> 00:03:28.209
violently shoved her to the floor

00:03:28.209 --> 00:03:30.711
and Heard also alluded to
quote one severe incident

00:03:30.711 --> 00:03:34.211
in December, 2015 when I
truly feared for my life.

00:03:34.211 --> 00:03:36.341
People magazine would
later publish a photo

00:03:36.341 --> 00:03:38.571
purportedly from this incident.

00:03:38.571 --> 00:03:40.921
In opposition to these
motions, Depp's lawyers

00:03:40.921 --> 00:03:42.181
claimed the allegations were false

00:03:42.181 --> 00:03:43.901
and accused Heard of quote attempting

00:03:43.901 --> 00:03:46.201
to secure a premature financial resolution

00:03:46.201 --> 00:03:47.415
by alleging abuse.

00:03:47.415 --> 00:03:49.271
On May 27th of that year.

00:03:49.271 --> 00:03:51.641
The judge granted Heard's
temporary restraining order

00:03:51.641 --> 00:03:53.681
ordering Depp to stay
at least 100 yards away

00:03:53.681 --> 00:03:56.053
and avoid all contact until
a June 17th follow up hearing

00:03:56.053 --> 00:03:59.511
that would decide whether the
order should be made permanent

00:03:59.511 --> 00:04:01.171
but hours before the scheduled hearing

00:04:01.171 --> 00:04:02.801
Heard and Depp released a joint statement,

00:04:02.801 --> 00:04:04.401
announcing that they had
resolved their dispute.

00:04:04.401 --> 00:04:06.641
Quote our relationship
was intensely passionate

00:04:06.641 --> 00:04:09.271
and at times volatile,
but always bound by love.

00:04:09.271 --> 00:04:11.869
Neither party has made false
accusations for financial gain.

00:04:11.869 --> 00:04:15.851
There was never any intent of
physical or emotional harm.

00:04:15.851 --> 00:04:18.081
Now in August of 2016, Depp and Heard

00:04:18.081 --> 00:04:20.991
reached a divorce settlement
with Heard allegedly pledging

00:04:20.991 --> 00:04:24.451
to donate 7 million to the
American Civil Liberties Union

00:04:24.451 --> 00:04:27.151
and the Children's
Hospital of Los Angeles.

00:04:27.151 --> 00:04:29.721
In August of 2021, a New York judge,

00:04:29.721 --> 00:04:32.601
partially granted Depp's
motion to force the ACLU

00:04:32.601 --> 00:04:34.361
to produce documents to show

00:04:34.361 --> 00:04:36.671
if she did in fact donate the $7 million,

00:04:36.671 --> 00:04:39.031
a fact that remains contested by Depp.

00:04:39.031 --> 00:04:42.651
And after the divorce was
finalized in January of 2017,

00:04:42.651 --> 00:04:44.191
Depp's attorney Laura Wasser

00:04:44.191 --> 00:04:45.461
released the following statement,

00:04:45.461 --> 00:04:47.811
quote, we are pleased to
put this unpleasant chapter

00:04:47.811 --> 00:04:50.211
in Mr. Depp and his
family's lives behind them

00:04:50.211 --> 00:04:53.031
having his request for entry
of the dissolution of judgment

00:04:53.031 --> 00:04:56.811
granted today made it a
particularly lucky Friday the 13th.

00:04:56.811 --> 00:04:58.301
Now, while Depp's attorneys declared

00:04:58.301 --> 00:05:01.041
their client's intention to
put this chapter behind him,

00:05:01.041 --> 00:05:03.371
the British tabloids
would not extend Mr. Depp

00:05:03.371 --> 00:05:07.371
such a courtesy, which takes
us to how the UK lawsuit

00:05:07.371 --> 00:05:08.511
got filed.

00:05:08.511 --> 00:05:10.521
Now, following the divorce,
both Heard and Depp

00:05:10.521 --> 00:05:12.641
continued to pursue their
respective acting careers.

00:05:12.641 --> 00:05:15.129
Heard reprised her role
as Mera from "Aquaman"

00:05:15.129 --> 00:05:18.011
for Josh Whedon's
"Justice League" in 2017,

00:05:18.011 --> 00:05:20.011
while Depp returned as
Captain Jack Sparrow

00:05:20.011 --> 00:05:22.491
for the fifth "Pirate of
the Caribbean" installment.

00:05:22.491 --> 00:05:24.821
But as Depp was preparing
to reprise his role

00:05:24.821 --> 00:05:26.268
as the autonomous villain in JK Rowling's

00:05:26.268 --> 00:05:28.431
"Fantastic Beasts The
Crimes of Grindelwald"

00:05:28.431 --> 00:05:31.389
The Sun, a British tabloid
fired a shot across the pond

00:05:31.389 --> 00:05:34.371
by rehashing Heard's abuse allegations.

00:05:34.371 --> 00:05:38.131
On April 27th, 2018, The Sun
executive editor, Dan Wooten

00:05:38.131 --> 00:05:41.101
published an article entitled, gone potty.

00:05:41.101 --> 00:05:43.391
How can JK Rowling be genuinely happy

00:05:43.391 --> 00:05:45.301
casting wife beater, Johnny Depp

00:05:45.301 --> 00:05:47.455
in the new "Fantastic Beasts" film.

00:05:47.455 --> 00:05:49.531
Writing that quote overwhelming evidence

00:05:49.531 --> 00:05:52.041
was filed to show Johnny Depp
engaged in domestic violence

00:05:52.041 --> 00:05:53.832
against his wife Amber Heard.

00:05:53.832 --> 00:05:55.941
Wooten accused the "Harry Potter" author

00:05:55.941 --> 00:05:58.781
of quote providing Depp
total rehabilitation

00:05:58.781 --> 00:06:02.021
in the eyes of the movie
industry by allowing Depp to star

00:06:02.021 --> 00:06:03.854
in the "Fantastic Beasts" sequel.

00:06:03.854 --> 00:06:06.131
Now Depp's response to
the article was swift.

00:06:06.131 --> 00:06:08.681
On June 1st, 2018 Depp
sued the parent company

00:06:08.681 --> 00:06:11.111
that publishes The Sun
in England for libel

00:06:11.111 --> 00:06:14.571
demanding a minimum of
$200,000 plus legal fees.

00:06:14.571 --> 00:06:17.171
Depp's attorneys argued
the article defamed him

00:06:17.171 --> 00:06:19.511
by presuming the actor was
guilty of domestic violence

00:06:19.511 --> 00:06:20.401
against his former wife

00:06:20.401 --> 00:06:22.871
highlighting the use of
the term wife beater.

00:06:22.871 --> 00:06:24.301
Now Depp's counsel maintained

00:06:24.301 --> 00:06:26.331
that these quote reputation destroying

00:06:26.331 --> 00:06:28.731
and career ending allegations were untrue

00:06:28.731 --> 00:06:31.071
and caused the actor quote serious harm,

00:06:31.071 --> 00:06:33.432
the threshold standard
for defamation in England.

00:06:33.432 --> 00:06:36.921
In its defense The Sun's
parent company argued

00:06:36.921 --> 00:06:38.091
that there was sufficient evidence

00:06:38.091 --> 00:06:40.911
to show that Depp was quote
a violent towards Miss Heard

00:06:40.911 --> 00:06:43.551
on multiple occasions
during their relationship

00:06:43.551 --> 00:06:46.621
making the term wife beater
an accurate statement.

00:06:46.621 --> 00:06:48.051
And in support of its claims,

00:06:48.051 --> 00:06:50.115
the company relied on 14 alleged
incidents of physical abuse

00:06:50.115 --> 00:06:53.081
against Heard that purportedly occurred

00:06:53.081 --> 00:06:55.561
between 2013 and 2016.

00:06:55.561 --> 00:06:57.781
Though neither Depp nor
Heard were on trial.

00:06:57.781 --> 00:06:59.681
The case was essentially a dress rehearsal

00:06:59.681 --> 00:07:01.650
for the pair's Virginia defamation trial

00:07:01.650 --> 00:07:04.701
with both Depp and Heard
giving live testimony

00:07:04.701 --> 00:07:07.231
detailing an array of graphic allegations.

00:07:07.231 --> 00:07:09.289
When Depp took the stand,

00:07:09.289 --> 00:07:10.821
he acknowledged wide
ranging drug problems,

00:07:10.821 --> 00:07:13.661
which he referred to as quote the monster,

00:07:13.661 --> 00:07:16.281
but Depp accused Heard
of making up allegations

00:07:16.281 --> 00:07:18.801
and insisting that he was
quote not a violent person,

00:07:18.801 --> 00:07:20.191
especially with a woman,

00:07:20.191 --> 00:07:23.011
a characterization that was
backed up in sworn statements

00:07:23.011 --> 00:07:26.332
from former partners, Winona
Rider and Vanessa Paradis.

00:07:26.332 --> 00:07:29.031
Depp portrayed Heard as the
aggressor in the relationship

00:07:29.031 --> 00:07:30.991
accusing her of repeatedly belittling him

00:07:30.991 --> 00:07:32.801
and frequently turning physically violent

00:07:32.801 --> 00:07:34.701
during their tumultuous marriage

00:07:34.701 --> 00:07:37.321
saying quote, it was sort of a rapid fire

00:07:37.321 --> 00:07:39.441
sort of endless parade of insults.

00:07:39.441 --> 00:07:42.501
Quote, you know, looking
at me like I was a fool

00:07:42.501 --> 00:07:44.871
and I was having difficulty
in my mind, of course,

00:07:44.871 --> 00:07:47.907
and in my heart, dealing
with that sort of barrage.

00:07:47.907 --> 00:07:51.421
Depp further alleged that Heard
would sometimes strike out

00:07:51.421 --> 00:07:52.961
in anger or frustration

00:07:52.961 --> 00:07:54.921
and regarding an alleged
headbutting incident

00:07:54.921 --> 00:07:57.691
in December of 2015 at his LA penthouse,

00:07:57.691 --> 00:08:01.001
Depp testified, he was
trying to hold Heard back

00:08:01.001 --> 00:08:04.671
from hitting him and their
foreheads collided by accident.

00:08:04.671 --> 00:08:07.771
Depp also detailed a
purported March, 2015 argument

00:08:07.771 --> 00:08:10.032
in Australia that led to part
of his finger being sliced off

00:08:10.032 --> 00:08:12.221
due to a thrown vodka bottle.

00:08:12.221 --> 00:08:14.401
Depp contended that Heard saw him drinking

00:08:14.401 --> 00:08:15.791
for the first time in a while.

00:08:15.791 --> 00:08:16.971
And she threw a bottle of vodka

00:08:16.971 --> 00:08:18.321
that narrowly missed his head

00:08:18.321 --> 00:08:19.641
before throwing a larger bottle

00:08:19.641 --> 00:08:21.081
that did strike his head.

00:08:21.081 --> 00:08:22.631
Photos provided by Depp's counsel

00:08:22.631 --> 00:08:24.521
purported to show Depp
with a bloody finger

00:08:24.521 --> 00:08:26.761
and a cigarette burn on his face.

00:08:26.761 --> 00:08:29.141
For her part, Heard denied injuring Depp

00:08:29.141 --> 00:08:31.541
contending that her ex
severed his own finger

00:08:31.541 --> 00:08:33.051
during a drug and alcohol binge

00:08:33.051 --> 00:08:35.751
after repeatedly smashing
a wall mounted phone

00:08:36.697 --> 00:08:37.713
against the wall.

00:08:37.713 --> 00:08:39.741
Heard testified that depth
fueled by drugs and alcohol

00:08:39.741 --> 00:08:42.591
hit, slapped and shoved
Heard, pulling her hair

00:08:42.591 --> 00:08:45.901
and threw bottles quote
like grenades at Heard

00:08:45.901 --> 00:08:49.101
at various incidents
between 2013 and 2016.

00:08:49.101 --> 00:08:51.551
On cross examination Heard
denied the characterization

00:08:51.551 --> 00:08:53.731
of Depp's lawyers that she was the one

00:08:53.731 --> 00:08:55.641
who struggled with drugs and alcohol,

00:08:55.641 --> 00:08:57.521
that she was the one who abused him.

00:08:57.521 --> 00:09:01.154
And that she was the one who
was controllingly manipulative,

00:09:01.154 --> 00:09:03.211
not Depp.

00:09:03.211 --> 00:09:05.581
Now under cross-examination Depp admitted,

00:09:05.581 --> 00:09:07.391
it was possible that
he destroyed the phone

00:09:07.391 --> 00:09:10.031
stating quote I remember
ripping the phone off the wall.

00:09:10.031 --> 00:09:11.421
Depp also admitted

00:09:11.421 --> 00:09:13.141
that he had previously
taken responsibility

00:09:13.141 --> 00:09:14.650
for severing his finger
though Depp claimed

00:09:14.650 --> 00:09:16.841
that he was only trying to protect Heard

00:09:16.841 --> 00:09:19.021
when he had to tell the
production company the injury

00:09:19.021 --> 00:09:21.151
prevented him from working on set.

00:09:21.151 --> 00:09:23.717
And Depp also confirmed that
he wrote messages for Heard

00:09:23.717 --> 00:09:28.541
in blood, paint and lipstick,
including quote I love you

00:09:28.541 --> 00:09:31.161
and quote good luck,
which he did to indicate

00:09:31.161 --> 00:09:33.452
he felt the relationship was over.

00:09:33.452 --> 00:09:35.411
And in a trial that had the couple

00:09:35.411 --> 00:09:38.201
airing out their dirty
laundry Depp also detailed

00:09:38.201 --> 00:09:41.201
an alleged incident involving
literal dirty laundry.

00:09:41.201 --> 00:09:43.251
Supposedly on the night
of Heard's birthday party

00:09:43.251 --> 00:09:45.971
in April, 2016, Depp says he arrived late

00:09:45.971 --> 00:09:47.991
due to a meeting he was attending.

00:09:47.991 --> 00:09:50.411
Depp testified that Heard
was furious with him

00:09:50.411 --> 00:09:52.777
hitting him multiple times
after the party ended,

00:09:52.777 --> 00:09:55.017
before he left and spent
the night at another home.

00:09:55.017 --> 00:09:58.261
Depp said that he planned to
retrieve items the next morning

00:09:58.261 --> 00:10:00.141
after Heard left for Coachella,

00:10:00.141 --> 00:10:02.713
but was told by someone at the
home who texted him a photo

00:10:02.713 --> 00:10:07.081
not to return because
there was poop in the bed.

00:10:07.081 --> 00:10:10.471
Quote, it was a photograph
of the bed, our bed,

00:10:10.471 --> 00:10:13.411
and on my side of the bed
was human fecal matter.

00:10:13.411 --> 00:10:16.981
So I understood why it wasn't
a good time to go down there.

00:10:16.981 --> 00:10:19.213
He continued my initial
response to that was,

00:10:19.213 --> 00:10:23.071
I mean, I laughed it was so
outside, it was so bizarre.

00:10:23.071 --> 00:10:25.881
And so grotesque that I could only laugh.

00:10:25.881 --> 00:10:27.671
Depp had previously claimed
in a written statement

00:10:27.671 --> 00:10:29.931
that Heard or one of her
friends were the culprit

00:10:29.931 --> 00:10:32.281
and alleged that Heard
had called this quote,

00:10:32.281 --> 00:10:33.901
just a harmless prank.

00:10:33.901 --> 00:10:36.152
But Depp said that incident
was when he knew their marriage

00:10:36.152 --> 00:10:40.611
was over and a month later
Heard filed for divorce.

00:10:40.611 --> 00:10:43.821
Heard has denied any
role in this poo demit

00:10:43.821 --> 00:10:48.441
suggesting the story is fabricated
simply to humiliate her.

00:10:48.441 --> 00:10:52.071
So yeah, the British trial
was incredibly colorful.

00:10:52.071 --> 00:10:53.831
And after hearing all of the evidence,

00:10:53.831 --> 00:10:55.796
the UK court sided with The Sun

00:10:55.796 --> 00:10:58.190
and rejected Depp's libel claims.

00:10:58.190 --> 00:11:00.351
In his November, 2020 opinion,

00:11:00.351 --> 00:11:02.901
Justice Andrew Nichol
concluded that The Sun

00:11:02.901 --> 00:11:05.291
had met its burden of proof
and that The Sun's allegations

00:11:05.291 --> 00:11:08.721
that Depp engaged in unprovoked
