that they were published

00:13:48.331 --> 00:13:50.551
with knowledge of being false or reckless

00:13:50.551 --> 00:13:52.121
regard for their truth or falsity.

00:13:52.121 --> 00:13:54.411
Again, actual malice has nothing to do

00:13:54.411 --> 00:13:58.036
with not liking a person, it
is an evidentiary standard,

00:13:58.036 --> 00:14:00.336
and it's not particularly well named.

00:14:00.336 --> 00:14:02.341
It's a legal term of art.

00:14:02.341 --> 00:14:04.311
And even with these built in advantages,

