00:16:55.391 --> 00:16:57.321
in another forum in the UK.

00:16:57.321 --> 00:16:59.801
And there is a principle of
law that prevents re-litigation

00:16:59.801 --> 00:17:02.091
of the same cause of
action in a second lawsuit

00:17:02.091 --> 00:17:03.561
between the same parties.

00:17:03.561 --> 00:17:04.841
It's called claim preclusion

00:17:04.841 --> 00:17:07.111
also referred to as res judicata,

00:17:07.111 --> 00:17:08.961
which is Latin for a matter decided

00:17:08.961 --> 00:17:12.171
basically it's like double
jeopardy, but for civil suits.

00:17:12.171 --> 00:17:14.294
And there's also issue
preclusion or collateral stoppel

00:17:14.294 --> 00:17:16.453
preventing a party from
re-litigating an issue

00:17:16.453 --> 00:17:18.921
once a court has already ruled on it.

